Package: zutabletest
Title: Consumer Fixture for the zutable Kernel Header
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not a real package and never published. It proves that
    zutable's kernel header can be consumed from another package's C code
    with LinkingTo alone: the kernel is header-only, so nothing of zutable
    is linked or loaded, and its tests run with zutable removed from the
    library. Built and run only by tools/ci/consumer.sh.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
LinkingTo: 
    zutable,
    zufast
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
